  "fullText": "This website uses cookies\nWe use cookies to personalise content and ads, to provide social media features and to analyse our traffic. We also share information about your use of our site with our social media, advertising and analytics partners who may combine it with other information that you’ve provided to them or that they’ve collected from your use of their services.\nShow details\nAllow all\nDeny\n\nTREATMENT INQUIRY\n\n+41 43 541 11 52\nCONTACT US\nMental Health & Addiction\nPrecision Medicine\nHealth Assessments\nExclusive Treatments\nAbout\nHospitality\nContact Us\nDrug Addiction\nAlcoholism\nNicotine addiction\nAnxiety Disorder\nPTSD\nDepression\nTrauma\nBipolar Disorder\nBurnout\nPerinatal Mental Health & Wellbeing\nGET IN TOUCH\nCONNECT WITH US\n\nWe treat all enquiries with the utmost discretion. Every journey begins with a conversation rooted in trust and understanding. We’re here to listen, to guide, and to offer clarity on what deeply personalised, transformative care could look like for you. Reach out to take the first step toward lasting change.\n\nSPEAK TO US\nWHATSAPP\nIMESSAGE\nTREATMENT ENQUIRY\nCONTACT NUMBERS & ADDRESSES\nGENERAL ENQUIRIES\n+41 43 541 11 52\ninfo@kusnachtpractice.ch\nTREATMENT ENQUIRIES\n+41 44 505 10 70\ntreatment@kusnachtpractice.ch\nOUR ADDRESS\nKusnacht Practice\nZollikerstrasse 60\n8702 Zollikon\nSwitzerland\nFAQ\nHow do I know if I need help from Kusnacht Practice?\nHow do I convince someone that I care about to visit Kusnacht Practice for therapy?\nWhat is different about Kusnacht Practice’s approach to treatment?\nHow long can I expect my treatment at Kusnacht Practice to last?\nWho will be responsible for my treatment at the treatment centre?\nVIEW ALL FAQS\nMENTAL HEALTH & ADDICTION\nINTERNAL MEDICINE\nLONGEVITY & REJUVENATION\nHEALTH ASSESSMENTS\nAESTHETIC MEDICINE\nHOSPITALITY\nOUR TEAM\nMEDIA\nBLOG\nINVESTMENT\nFAQ\nCONTACT\nCAREER\nIMPRINT\nPRIVACY STATEMENT\nLINKEDIN\nINSTAGRAM\nFACEBOOK\nYOUTUB